cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite the versioned release below and the official source listed in the README."
type: dataset
title: "Casablanca protected-heritage register (December 2021): 109 source rows"
authors:
  - family-names: Rochd
    given-names: Reda
version: 1.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-07
url: "https://github.com/reda-rochd/casablanca-protected-heritage-register-2021/releases/tag/v1.1.1"
repository-code: "https://github.com/reda-rochd/casablanca-protected-heritage-register-2021"
abstract: >-
  Arabic-first CSV extract of the 109 Casablanca rows in the Ministry of Youth,
  Culture and Communication's December 2021 Casablanca-Settat heritage register.
  Preserves source names, categories, years, official references and source row
  indexes. The extract does not establish unique site counts, current legal
  status, conservation condition, coordinates, or visitor access.
keywords:
  - Casablanca
  - Morocco
  - cultural heritage
  - open data
  - ODbL
notes: >-
  Dataset and chart are released under ODbL 1.0. Extractor and explorer code
  are licensed under MIT as scoped in the README. Cite the Ministry/portal
  source as well as this adapted extract.
